/**
 * Barndom & ungdom, 1201–1207 (0.29): the life phases from baby to young adult – babies (sitting,
 * lying, on the tummy, crawling, standing toddler), pre-school play, the school child's everyday,
 * puberty and teenage years, independence, young people's interests and the step into adult life.
 * Babies and toddlers are drawn with big heads so that the age is clear at 120 px.
 */
